---

<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-constant">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`PRIM_SCULPT_TYPE_MASK: number = 7`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`integer PRIM_SCULPT_TYPE_MASK = 7;`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The integer constant PRIM_SCULPT_TYPE_MASK has the value 7</p>
  <p>PRIM_SCULPT_TYPE_MASK can be used when parsing the output of <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlGetPrimitiveParams" target="_blank">llGetPrimitiveParams</a> when dealing with sculpted prims (<a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PRIM_TYPE_SCULPT" target="_blank">PRIM_TYPE_SCULPT</a>) to separate the sculpted type from the flags (<a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PRIM_SCULPT_FLAG_INVERT" target="_blank">PRIM_SCULPT_FLAG_INVERT</a> and <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PRIM_SCULPT_FLAG_MIRROR" target="_blank">PRIM_SCULPT_FLAG_MIRROR</a>) that can modify it.</p>
  <p><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Sculpted_Prims:_FAQ" target="_blank">Sculpted Prims: FAQ</a></p>
</p>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Member Of</div>
